33
00:02:57,280 --> 00:03:11,840
但随着这次 MCP 事件的新公告，开发者可以让他们自己的
MCP 连接应用在订阅事件发生时，直接向 ChatGPT 发送更新。
But with this new announcement of MCP events, it's a way for developers to let their
own MCP connected apps send updates directly to ChatGPT when a subscribed event happens.

34
00:03:12,142 --> 00:03:20,320
所以你可以告诉 ChatGPT 要监控什么，以及如何通
过所有连接的应用做出反应，然后它就会自动执行。
So you can tell ChatGPT what to monitor and then how to respond through all of your connected apps, and then it will act on its own.

35
00:03:20,654 --> 00:03:23,044
