00:03:31,246 --> 00:03:41,572
这是他们给在欧盟境内的 ChatGPT 或 Codex 文本中加入的隐形水印起的名字。
This is the name that they gave to an invisible watermark that they're
going to put inside of Chat GPT or codex text inside of the European Union.

