由于这里法规的变化，他们在欧盟境内的 Claude 生成文本中加入了自己的水印。
They have their own watermark in Claude generated text within the
European Union, within the EU, because of the changing regulations here.

43
00:04:16,398 --> 00:04:21,552
现在，和所有这些文本水印一样，它们并不完美。
Now, as with all of these text watermarks, they are not perfect.

44
00:04:21,712 --> 00:04:23,392
这不是一个完美的解决方案。
This is not a perfect solution.

45
00:04:23,472 --> 00:04:25,508
