I don't know that there necessarily is one.

46
00:04:26,032 --> 00:04:30,512
你使用的检测器，也就是信号检测器，可能会出现误报。
The detectors that you use, the signal detectors, can have false positives.

47
00:04:30,862 --> 00:04:33,792
也就是说，在没有水印的情况下报告有水印。
So that means reporting a watermark when there is none.

48
00:04:33,998 --> 00:04:35,844
而且它们也可能出现漏报。
And they can also have false negatives.

49
00:04:36,032 --> 00:04:39,300
也就是说，漏掉文本中存在的水印。
So missing a watermark that is present in the text.

50
00:04:39,886 --> 00:04:46,212
此外，在使用这类文本水印时，你必须考虑到两个主要的风险。
And also there are two major risks that you have to have in mind with these types of text watermarks.

51
00:04:46,606 --> 00:04:51,524
一个是短文本，在其中检测难度要大得多。
And that's one that shorter text, it's much harder to detect it within that.

52
00:04:51,854 --> 00:04:54,596
然后，编辑可能会削弱水印。
And then editing can weaken the watermark.

53
00:04:54,958 --> 00:05:01,860
所以水印不是保证，但它是 OpenAI 可能参与了该文本的一个线索。
So the watermark is not a guarantee, but it's a clue that OpenAI may have been involved in that text.

