如果任何人都能提问并建立自己的仪表盘，我认为这可能是一把双刃剑。
If anyone can ask questions about data and then build their own dashboards, that that I think could be both a good and a bad thing.

65
00:06:09,102 --> 00:06:18,788
仅仅因为你提出了要求，并不意味着你的查询符合它应该符合的业务定义，
或者你可能没有包含正确的上下文。
Just because you ask for something doesn't mean your query matches the business definition that it should,
or you might not be including the right context.

66
00:06:19,374 --> 00:06:26,756
这些事情是数据和商业智能团队在构建仪表盘时始终会考虑到的，他们也会一直非常小心。
Things like these are things that the data and the BI team would always have
in mind and they would always be careful whenever they're building dashboards.

67
