And I think as it is it becomes easier to interact with data through
natural language, then BI teams, in the end, their work is going to change.

69
00:06:46,032 --> 00:06:50,992
我不认为他们会被淘汰，但我认为情况会发生变化。
I don't think they're going to be eliminated by any means, but I think things are going to change.

