00:06:51,278 --> 00:06:59,716
所以公司里的任何人员，可能都会自己处理一些关于数据的简单探索性问题。
So people might handle in any person in the company, they might handle more simple exploratory questions themselves about the data.

71
00:07:00,142 --> 00:07:11,240
而商业智能团队可以专注于更宏观的工作，确保他们提供可信的数据，创建良好的共享指标定义，
并继续构建人们在做重大决策时应依赖的主要仪表盘。
while the BI teams can focus on this bigger picture work, and they can make sure that they're supporting with trusted data and that
they're creating these good shared metric definitions and still building

